{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_220","type":"reasoning","text":"Let me check the reference solution commit d6f0faa8e more thoroughly. Actually, I now understand the task clearly:\n\nThe workspace agent needs to:\n1. Remove stale references in the a5 spec's requiredTests to non-existent paths (`tests/unit/cross-area-composition.test.ts`, `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/cross-area/cross-area-facades.ts`)... but wait, the task says \"恢复 area-composition-spec.md 指定的 ContextBudgetPlanner（含 replanOnResume）组合 facade\" - restore the ContextBudgetPlanner facade.\n\nWait. The hidden oracle test (`tests/unit/a05-a5-gate-coverage.test.ts`) REQUIRES:\n- All REQUIRED_TESTS present (including `tests/unit/cross-area-composition.test.ts` and `tests/unit/deep/a5-deep.test.ts`)\n- `tests/unit/cross-area-composition.test.ts` present with \"resume re-runs budget planner\"\n- `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/cross-area/cross-area-facades.ts` present with `class ContextBudgetPlanner`, `replanOnResume`, `hasReexecuted`\n- `tests/unit/deep/a5-deep.test.ts` present with \"ContextBudgetPlanner\"\n\nSo this A05 task differs from the *historical* A05 (which said NO-GO on criterion 3.6). The task instruction says to RESTORE the facade and tests. So the workspace agent must CREATE:\n1. `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/cross-area/cross-area-facades.ts` (with ContextBudgetPlanner + replanOnResume)\n2. `tests/unit/cross-area-composition.test.ts`\n3. `tests/unit/deep/a5-deep.test.ts`\n4. `tests/unit/a05-a5-gate-coverage.test.ts` (own guard)\n5. Update `harness/specs/tasks/a5-adaptive-context-budget-pilot.md` requiredTests to include these\n6. Update `harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a05-adaptive-context-budget-pilot-reverify.md`\n7. `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a05-adaptive-context-budget-gate.md`\n8. `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a05-acceptance.json`\n9. `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/A05-SHA256SUMS`\n\nBUT the hidden oracle test is `tests/unit/a05-a5-gate-coverage.test.ts` (hiddenSignalPaths). At g